OL,3,GNEWSABringing landfill into the 21st
OL,4,ACentury with solar power
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe building of solar farms on
OL,7,Fagricultural land is a divisive
OL,8,Fsubject.
OL,10,FPlans have recently been approved for
OL,11,Fone of the biggest solar plants in
OL,12,FEngland. It will stretch across 2,965
OL,13,Facres (1,200 hectares) of land south
OL,14,Fand west of Wellingborough, north of
OL,15,FNorthampton and parts of
OL,16,FBuckinghamshire.
OL,18,FMany people feel panels should be built
OL,19,Fon brownfield sites instead. Using
OL,20,Fformer landfill sites is an option.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
