OL,3,GNEWSABringing landfill into the 21st
OL,4,ACentury with solar power
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Brogborough in Bedfordshire, one is
OL,7,Fcurrently being built on what Infinis,
OL,8,Fthe company behind the work, said was
OL,9,F"Europe's biggest landfill."
